{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$g : Y \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{M}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}_Y$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0007": "$S$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{M}$", "MATH_0009": "$g$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{L} \\otimes f^*\\mathcal{M}^{\\otimes a}$", "MATH_0013": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0014": "$a \\gg 0$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-ample-composition}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7f7fa97199a1fdac969a0fa437966bba233163e502ee03340e77caa2126a1762", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:32415612c4153d32e12e5a18ede7dae780dec64a4e140178ec5207b557e290d0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be morphisms of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0003> be an invertible <MATH_0004>-module.\nLet <MATH_0005> be an invertible <MATH_0006>-module.\nIf <MATH_0007> is quasi-compact, <MATH_0008> is <MATH_0009>-ample, and\n<MATH_0010> is <MATH_0011>-ample, then\n<MATH_0012>\nis <MATH_0013>-ample for <MATH_0014>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9d621ed122bca0b898e014368ffbfaa05c5f3c75b927b25d856e2b151080e0ce", "unit_id": "tag:0C4K:statement"}
